	(gr_text "🔵 L5 — Inner Signal Layer\n\nNow safe because L4 is GND.\n\nUse for:\n\nSPI (if space tight)\n\nPWM\n\nEncoders\n\nI2C\n\nGeneral routing congestion relief\n\nGood practice:\n\nAdd stitching vias near signal vias.\n\nKeep sensitive signals away from motor switching nodes."
